// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in to enable authenticated
// endpoints (your library, personalised recommendations) during development.
//
// NEVER commit Secrets.xcconfig, and never ship a build containing a token:
// anyone with the .ipa can extract it and act as your account.
MB_PAT = mb-your-personal-access-token-here

// Google Books, used only to fill in covers for series Apple Books does not
// sell. Optional: without it the app asks Google nothing and simply shows the
// covers it already has.
//
// A key is needed because Google's keyless tier shares one anonymous quota
// pool with every unauthenticated caller on the internet, and it was already
// exhausted when this was checked (HTTP 429, 2026-09-12) — so keyless is not
// "slower", it is "mostly broken".
//
// Unlike MB_PAT this is a quota identifier, not a credential: someone who
// extracts it can spend your Books quota, not reach your account. Restrict it
// to this app's bundle id in the Google Cloud console anyway. It lives here,
// in the Debug-only include, so no Release build carries it.
MB_GOOGLE_BOOKS_KEY = your-google-books-api-key-here
